        {
          "statusId": 20331,
          "targetCamps": 5,
          "target": "ally",
          "description": "These actions by Deren begin to interfere with reality: \"survive more than 24 seconds in the battle\", \"perform Normal Attack 12 times\", and \"use Ultimate 3 times.\" Reaching certain counts of [Interfere] can give Deren different buffs in this battle.\n[Interfere] *1: [Edit] now allows Deren to attack rapidly instead and its Damage Coefficient increases by ?%.\n[Interfere] *2: [Screenplay] now allows Deren to move to the target grid instead and deal Physical Damage and 1 Core Damage to all enemies in the two grids in front. Its Damage Coefficient increases by ?%. Can be charged up to 2 times. CRIT is now possible with this Ultimate. CRIT effect depends on Deren's CRIT Rate and CRIT Damage bonus.\n[Interfere] *3: Each time after Deren moves, she gains a ?% Attack Speed boost for 10 seconds.",
